# BMad Method — vendored from upstream and rewritten by `npx skills update` + `bmad setup`.
# Marked generated so PR diffs collapse them and GitHub's language stats skip them.
# `-text` keeps them byte-identical to upstream (one ships CRLF), so they match skills-lock.json.
.claude/skills/bmad*/** -text linguist-generated=true linguist-vendored=true
.claude/skills/bmod-*/** -text linguist-generated=true linguist-vendored=true
_bmad/scripts/** linguist-generated=true linguist-vendored=true
_bmad/*/scripts/** linguist-generated=true linguist-vendored=true
skills-lock.json linguist-generated=true
